  "Усреднение по объёму: <button type=\"button\" class=\"term\" data-term=\"kvol\">k<sub>vol</sub></button> (TRS-398) / P<sub>rp</sub> (TG-51)": "Volume averaging: <button type=\"button\" class=\"term\" data-term=\"kvol\">k<sub>vol</sub></button> (TRS-398) / P<sub>rp</sub> (TG-51)",
  "Способ": "Method",
  "по формуле (22) TRS-398": "by TRS-398 Eq. (22)",
